	(text "VSYS 4.5-24 V -> +5V 3 A (15 W). On a 5 V USB port the converter runs in dropout (~98 % duty):\n+5V ~ 4.8 V, enough for the TLV62569 bucks; the firmware keeps 5V_OUT off.\nLayout: C21 and C19/C20 against VIN and the PGND pad, short SW node, FB divider away from L1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "27211277-ce92-5c5d-bef4-b65a60718ad0")
	)
